==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|es|en}} {{m|es||[[sin]] [[semilla]]|without seeds (aka "seedless")}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A technique of growing [[cannabis]] where only the female is allowed to blossom. Without pollen from the male plant, the female blossoms produce no seeds, forming large [[panicled]] flowers.

